designer_notes = "A DEER'S GAIT (hunting, 2026-11-09, HERBALISM_HUNTING_PREP.md §7 step 3): it grazes at a walk and bolts at a gallop a little FASTER than a player's sprint (8.6 against 8 m/s), so it is caught with the bow, or cornered, not run down. It gets up to speed and stops less sharply than a person (30 against 70 and 60). Claude's numbers, Luke's to change."
